Bharata Śatrughna order shrine worship road leveling and decoration --- Elephants chariots queens citizens shake earth to Nandigrāma --- Bharata with pādukās umbrella chowries goes to meet Rāma --- Bharata doubts vānara fickleness at Rāma absence --- Hanumān describes fruited trees Gōmatī roar dust and Puṣpaka with kin --- Citizens shout Rāma dismount and Bharata worships vimāna Rāma --- Bharata bows embraces Rāma Lakṣmaṇa Sītā vānaras and honors Vibhīṣaṇa --- Śatrughna greets kin Rāma greets mothers priest and citizens cheer --- Bharata returns pādukās kingdom tenfold amid vānara tears --- Rāma dismisses vimāna to Kubēra and honors priest at āśram